The rows is 5.
The columns is 6.
The total is rows times columns.
Keep a shared answers as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared found as 0.
Keep a shared label as empty text.
Keep a shared line as 0.
Keep a shared column as 0.
Set line to 1.
Set column to 4.
To record.
The linetext is format whole number line as text.
Set label to linetext.
Place "," into label.
The columntext is format whole number column as text.
Place columntext into label.
The copy is a copy of label.
Place copy into answers.
Add 1 to found.

Record.
The runleft is 0.
The legs is 0.
The heading is 0.
Repeat while found is less than total.
If runleft is 0, add 1 to legs, set runleft to (legs plus 1) divided by 2, set heading to (legs minus 1) modulo 4.
If heading is 0, add 1 to column.
If heading is 1, add 1 to line.
If heading is 2, subtract 1 from column.
If heading is 3, subtract 1 from line.
If line is at least 0 and line is less than rows and column is at least 0 and column is less than columns, record.
Subtract 1 from runleft.

For each entry in answers, show entry.
